=B. The dark road symbolizes the community's repeated desire to leave.#Correct. This is an arguable interpretation supported by evidence. Notice how the answer uses the exact wording, evidence, or concept required by the standard.
~C. The rivers are faded because the map has been used a lot.#This explains a detail literally. Recheck the passage, context, or task wording and choose the option that preserves meaning and matches the standard.
